      {
        "n": "The Opera Show - Owed to Unearthing(s) Part II",
        "s": "2026-09-26T14:00:00+01:00",
        "e": "2026-09-26T15:00:00+01:00",
        "d": "Hannah Catherine Jones splits things open for the Opera Show: an exploration of the best in opera old and new, as well as an unearthing of the operatic in other records from soul, jazz or further afield.\nFrom the host: \"Owed to Unearthing(s) is a two-part special excavating the influences, samples and interpolations I used to compose the soundscape for my recent exhibition UNEARTHING(S) commissioned by Yorkshire Contemporary at Leeds Art Gallery.\"",
        "j": "Owed to Unearthing(s) Part II",
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/the-opera-show/episodes/the-opera-show-26th-september-2026",
